  "instance_name": "mapping_racist_dehumanization",
  "label": "Black children mapped to 'sea monkeys' toy creatures",
  "description": "The core analogical mapping of this racist meme: the text 'sea monkeys' is positioned directly above and spatially associated with the visual content of Black children playing in water. This creates a dehumanizing comparison mapping the Black children onto the Sea-Monkeys toy product (brine shrimp sold as novelty pets that 'come to life' when added to water). The mapping exploits the visual context of children in water to make a racist 'joke' comparing them to small aquatic creatures, invoking both the monkey racial slur and the Sea-Monkeys product reference. The spatial positioning of the text overlay forces viewers to interpret the children through this racist lens.",
